                              "relaunch in mapping mode (localization:=false). The new "
                              "map may be disconnected from the loaded one.")
                # Tear down the localization-mode stack first so we do not leak the
                # previous roslaunch / double-launch move_base + rtabmap container.
                self.shutdown_navi_launch()
                self.start_navi_launch(["localization:=false"])
